        <headline>Storm Warning issued September 25 at 9:47PM EDT until September 26 at 7:00AM EDT by NWS Wakefield VA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 30 to 40 kt with gusts up to 50 kt and seas
11 to 16 ft.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Fenwick Island DE to Chincoteague
VA out 20 NM and Coastal waters from Chincoteague to Parramore
Island VA out 20 NM.

* WHEN...Until 7 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Storm force winds and hazardous seas will capsize or
damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should remain in port, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for severe conditions.</instruction>
